</div></header>
<main id="main">
<article class="section"><div class="wrap">
<h1>Hello World</h1>
<p class="tag"><time datetime="2026-01-05T00:00:00Z">2026-01-05</time></p>
<div class="prose">
<h1>Hello World</h1>
<p>Welcome to the <strong>demo</strong> homespace. It renders with GFM.</p>
<ul>
<li>one</li>
<li>two</li>
</ul>
<p>A <a href="https://example.com">link to a site</a> — navigation is allowed.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>a</th>
<th>b</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>2</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
&lt;script&gt;alert('xss')&lt;/script&gt;

</div>
</div></article>

</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap"><p>© demo</p></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
"
